<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46887" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡλιόομαι</span></b> , 
			Pass.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>live in the sun, be
				exposed to the sun</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡλιωμένος</span>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσκιατροφηκώς</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				556d
			</span></i>; of Places, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅπως ἡ γῆ ἡλιωθῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>CP</u>
					3.4.1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>HP</u>
				1.10.3
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἡλιούμενα</span>
			<i>parts exposed to the sun</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				19.18
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ούμενος ἀήρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.Med.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				9.5.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>to be sun-struck</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡλιοῦσθαι τὴν κεφαλήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
				</span></i>
			<i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				3
			</span></i>; or <i>sunburnt</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Muson.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				19p.107H.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>to be illuminated by the sunlight</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>de An.</u>
				419b31
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pr.</u>
				913a22
			</span></i>:—late in 
				Act.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡλιόω</span></b> , <i>place in the
				sun</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				1.102
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				112
			</span></i>, al.</div>
